Media server and persistent storage on a tiny Raspberry Pi 5

Install
-------

On Debian, run the following command and follow the instructions:

```
  /bin/bash -c "$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/akopdev/diskette/HEAD/install.sh)"

```
The installer will prompt you to set variables and secrets, then perform the initial server configuration.

After installation, you can use the `diskette` command to maintain the server.

```
$ diskette help

Usage: diskette <command>

Commands:
  install                     Setup server from scratch
  update                      Update already running server
  backup                      Backup server
  restore [SNAPSHOT]          Restore server from backup snapshot
  start [SERVICE]             Start service
  stop [SERVICE]              Stop running service
  restart [SERVICE]           Restart all services
  logs [SERVICE]              Show full log history
  help                        Show this help
```
